Z||000012||maryjane||07-21-2001||01:37 PM||||Whoohoo-the fashion police are handin out citations today. Ever spend all day on a fence line without a brimmed hat? Not a cloud in the sky and 105 deg? Makin fun of a man's hat can get your eyes dotted PDQ around here. How many mesquite thorns will a pair of $100 fashionable tennis shoes deflect? String a little wire on a ranch thats divided in sections(1 sq mile), not acres, see how long a pair of Dockers last. I'm a machinist now but used to work on the Mcleroy.I've stepped in more BS than will ever be slung around on the OT section. The last colt I broke was the third wk of June at my Dad's.I DO think the 4x6 belt buckles look pretty ridiculous. <BR>Most of you would look out of place here. we would ALL look out of place overseas. Wouldn't it be a dull place if everyone dressed the same?<BR> I take no personal offense at anything anyone has said here, and don't mean any to anyone else. he**, Jane's been trying to change the way I dress for years. Not havin much luck.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><BR>Don<p>[This message has been edited by maryjane (edited 07-21-2001).]||||reg||1
