Z||000014||Stage-2GT||07-21-2001||03:06 PM|||| Ya know, Rainmaker, The past is in the past. If we want to have a shot at any future we must leave it there. I agree what the European settlers did to the Indians was quite sad. But by the same token, what can be done today to right those wrongs? I am 1/8 Cherokee, my Grand mother on my fathers side was full blooded. My mother is 100% Spanish, my Father is half Cherokee and half Irish. What can I possibly do to ease your pain? <BR>  What the world needs is the systematic eradication of all forms of racial and ethnical bias and predjudice. There is nothing that can be done today to eleminate the err's of the past. But we can control the shape of the future. <BR>  I am a cowboy, I have worked horeses and cattle, mended fences, thrown hay and cleaned stables. I am also an hispanic that untill I was five spoke very little english and now can't remember hardly any spanish. I am also an Indian who would be laughed at by tribal elders because of my pale complexion and blue eyes. I am also a European (Irish) despised by most because of my ancestrial link to the marauders of the old world. The world is the way it is now and probably won't change much in the near future. But, for our time here, we can only hope for the best and give our best. Those who can't or won't should be shot on sight. Every living man and woman on this earth has two purposes, live and let live. Untill you can treat those around you with the respect that you youeself demand, then you will remain ignorant. Ignorance is weakness. There was some one on this forum who had the perfect sinature. "Knowledge is Power...That's why the ignorant remain Weak!!!" Try not to be ignorant.<BR>  Like I said I am a cowboy, yet I don't condem those who are different from me. I accept them for who they are and respect them the way I want to be respected. You think a 4X6 buckle looks rediculous? how about pants sagging to the bottonm of your A$$? Or, how about shorts and pants so tight that you cant tell if they were jumped into ot sprayed on? It's what's behinfd the clothes and hair. It's the person inside. Please don't show me your anger for things I had nothing to do with, because all you'll get is anger in return.<P>S2GT <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"><P>------------------<BR>"If Hate Was Money, I Would Own The World"||||reg||1
Z||000015||Songman||07-21-2001||04:19 PM||||Where is that picture of my Dodge Power Wagon? You'd love it! Step side, suspension raised 7 inches, sitting on 13 inch wide 38s! 4.55 gears in it! Will only run about 70mph wide open but will climb a tree any day of the week.... Oh yeah! Almost forgot! It's this ugly ass brown color but it will and has pulled every yuppie SUV including all the pretty Jeeps out of bad spots around here....<P>I'm no cowboy but I do ride horses, drive pick-up trucks, and listen to country music.. but I also drive expensive sports cars, dress up nice, and eat in fine restaurants where they make you wear shoes and you can't spit on the floor...<P>I can tell you now that I would rather be a cowboy than one of this backwards hat wearing, skinhead, play your music do damn loud that your teeth will eventually fall out punk boys who think THEY are God's gift to the Earth...<P>At least a cowboy usually has some raising and respect for other people... turn that F'ing music down when you ride past my house! hehe<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
