Z||000028||AusFiero||07-22-2001||09:14 PM||||Hmm man explanation of fair dinkum. It is a very adaptable saying a bit like an F word used is adaptable.<BR>Some examples.<P>Are you being Fair Dinkum.  - Are you telling the truth.<BR>Fair Dinkum it was a great day out. - No I am not kidding you it was a great day out.<BR>A Fair Dinkum Aussie Akubra. -  A real Aussie Akubra.<BR>It was a Fair Dinkum bargain. - It was a great bargain.<P>Basically it is a good saying for truth, is something real, something good.<P><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.auto-alley.com" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||1
